<title>FINLAND: ENSTO 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 9.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>ENSTO 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 9.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     9.9 vs 3.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.01 vs 0.05</p>
<p> Net sales					  355.2 vs 315.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    44.5 vs 42.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish electrical components maker is</p>
<p>Oy Ensto Ab.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
